  (descr "AMASS XT30PW-M (XT30PW-M30.G.Y, LCSC C431092) right-angle horizontal PCB male XT30 battery connector, built FROM SCRATCH from the Amass product spec PDF (local parts-library/datasheets/XT30PW-M/XT30PW-M.pdf = lcsc.com/datasheet/C431092.pdf), Installation Hole Diagram sec.9: 2x contact holes drill 1.90 (solder tails dia 1.60) at 5.00 pitch; 2x NPTH locating pegs drill 1.00 at 11.00 spacing, peg row 10.00 toward mating face from contact row; mating face (= intended PCB edge, no overhang, male bullets are recessed in the cup) 3.05 in front of peg row = 13.05 in front of contact row; body 9.90 wide x 9.00 deep, wings span 13.30, solder tails elbow into the board 4.05 behind the body back face reaching 0.90 past hole centers (total 13.95). POLARITY: pad 1 = V+ = LEFT pad viewed from board top with mating face up-screen; pad 2 = V-. Determination chain: molded '+' and '-' on housing underside read from two independent photo sets (LCSC C431092 assets.lcsc.com product photos, mjbots.com/products/xt30pw-m photos), identical arrangement, mapped into board frame via peg/tail orientation; cross-checks: facing the plug '+' is viewer-right at the SQUARE end of the D-profile, '-' at the chamfered-corner end (single 45 deg chamfer at top-left facing the plug, per Amass front-view drawing, mjbots part photo, and moteus r4.11 board edge photo of mounted XT30PW-M); matches robocore.json J_BAT pad1=V+/VPACK, pad2=V-/GND. Welding-foot length below board 3.0mm (M30 variant).")
